1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,421
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,421 --> 00:00:03,183
Let's learn colors!

3
00:00:03,733 --> 00:00:05,668
Colors are everywhere!

4
00:00:07,019 --> 00:00:08,828
This is red.

5
00:00:09,328 --> 00:00:10,461
Red! Look,

6
00:00:10,461 --> 00:00:11,767
a red apple!

7
00:00:12,317 --> 00:00:13,124
Red!

8
00:00:14,474 --> 00:00:16,331
This is blue.

9
00:00:16,831 --> 00:00:18,009
Blue! Look,

10
00:00:18,009 --> 00:00:19,271
a blue ball!

11
00:00:19,821 --> 00:00:20,667
Blue!

12
00:00:22,017 --> 00:00:23,970
This is yellow.

13
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:25,722
Yellow! Look,

14
00:00:25,722 --> 00:00:27,131
the yellow sun!

15
00:00:27,681 --> 00:00:28,649
Yellow!

16
00:00:29,999 --> 00:00:31,856
This is green.

17
00:00:32,356 --> 00:00:33,614
Green! Look,

18
00:00:33,614 --> 00:00:34,957
a green leaf!

19
00:00:35,507 --> 00:00:36,434
Green!

20
00:00:37,784 --> 00:00:39,760
This is orange.

21
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,533
Orange! Look,

22
00:00:41,533 --> 00:00:43,123
an orange orange!

23
00:00:43,673 --> 00:00:44,762
Orange!

24
00:00:46,112 --> 00:00:47,969
This is purple.

25
00:00:48,469 --> 00:00:51,170
Purple! Look, purple grapes!

26
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:52,648
Purple!

27
00:00:53,998 --> 00:00:55,784
This is pink.

28
00:00:56,284 --> 00:00:57,534
Pink! Look,

29
00:00:57,534 --> 00:00:58,784
a pink pig!

30
00:00:59,334 --> 00:01:00,120
Pink!

31
00:01:01,470 --> 00:01:03,327
This is brown.

32
00:01:03,827 --> 00:01:05,018
Brown! Look,

33
00:01:05,018 --> 00:01:06,367
a brown teddy!

34
00:01:06,917 --> 00:01:07,885
Brown!

35
00:01:09,235 --> 00:01:11,544
What color is the banana?

36
00:01:13,744 --> 00:01:16,446
Yellow! The banana is yellow!

37
00:01:17,796 --> 00:01:20,248
What color is the strawberry?

38
00:01:22,448 --> 00:01:25,110
Red! The strawberry is red!

39
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:28,817
What color is the broccoli?

40
00:01:31,017 --> 00:01:33,779
Green! The broccoli is green!

41
00:01:35,129 --> 00:01:37,272
What color is the whale?

42
00:01:39,472 --> 00:01:41,790
Blue! The whale is blue!

43
00:01:43,140 --> 00:01:46,288
Red, blue, yellow, green, orange, purple,

44
00:01:46,288 --> 00:01:47,576
pink and brown!

45
00:01:47,826 --> 00:01:50,346
We know so many colors!

46
00:01:50,896 --> 00:01:53,134
Great job, little learner!

47
00:01:53,684 --> 00:01:55,572
Share Mimzi with a friend,

48
00:01:55,572 --> 00:01:58,112
and subscribe for more learning fun!

49
00:01:58,662 --> 00:01:59,606
Next time,

50
00:01:59,606 --> 00:02:01,565
let's sing about shapes.

51
00:02:01,815 --> 00:02:03,186
Bye bye!
